## 12. Milestone 2 Status

The initial architecture for AutoCare AI has been designed with four independent microservices.

The remaining Milestone 2 work includes:

- Inspecting and validating the generated dataset
- Confirming the input features and target column
- Cleaning and preprocessing the data
- Training multiple classification models
- Comparing model performance
- Selecting the final model
- Saving the complete preprocessing and prediction pipeline
- Testing the model using a new vehicle input
- Recording the evaluation results in GitHub

The architecture may be refined during implementation if the confirmed dataset structure or service requirements require minor changes.
